sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Panel as ActionPresetPanel
    participant Sel as selectionStore/shotStore
    participant Store as editorProjectStore
    participant Factory as createPresetEvents
    participant Valid as timelineEventValidator
    participant Cmd as ProjectCommand
    participant Eval as evaluateShotAtTime(正式)
    participant Renderer as StageRenderer/Preview/Export

    User->>Panel: 选择图层 + 选预设 + 填参数
    Panel->>Sel: getSelectedLayerId / getCurrentShotId
    Sel-->>Panel: layerId / shotId (none→禁用)
    Panel->>Factory: createPresetEvents(project, shotId, layerId, presetId, params)
    Factory->>Valid: validatePresetApplication(candidateEvents)
    alt 越界/失效引用/锁定
        Valid-->>Panel: { ok:false, errors }
        Panel-->>User: 可理解错误反馈（不静默）
    else 通过
        Valid-->>Factory: ok
        Factory-->>Panel: TimelineEvent[] (唯一id/整数ms)
        Panel->>Store: updateProject(追加事件后的Project, label)
        Store->>Cmd: new ProjectCommand(before, after, apply)
        Cmd-->>Store: redo() 落地
        Note over Cmd: History 记录 → undo/redo 可用
        Renderer->>Eval: evaluateShotAtTime(shot, timeMs, project)
        Eval-->>Renderer: EvaluatedShot (8类事件已生效)
        Renderer-->>User: 所见=预览=导出一致
    end
